# env.optional — fallbacks only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify fallback (apify_google_ads.py). If set -> Apify actor when the Transparency Center
# SPA is too anti-bot for Playwright in a run; else -> the keyless Playwright scraper,
# degrading to a `site:adstransparency.google.com` web search (default). Primary path needs
# no key:
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Proxy for the Playwright scraper (Robomotion Proxy); also read from --proxy.
HTTPS_PROXY
